1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:16,052
All five situations from lessons 1–5 — three options each and a full model dialogue with the examiner. Plus twelve phrases to reach agreement in any situation and five mistakes that cost people points. Get ready and speak out loud!

2
00:00:16,967 --> 00:00:33,941
How does task 4 work? The examiner describes a situation and shows three options. You suggest one. She usually says she doesn’t like it — and you suggest another. In the end you agree and say why. You can get seven points for this task.

3
00:00:34,833 --> 00:00:51,180
The dialogue has a simple plan. You suggest one option. The examiner says why not. You calmly suggest another. And when she asks why, you answer: protože. Now let’s go through all five situations. Speak yourself first, then you hear the model.

4
00:00:52,067 --> 00:00:55,319
Situation 1: A friend’s birthday is coming.

5
00:00:55,633 --> 00:01:04,339
Our friend has a birthday soon. We want to buy her a present together. What shall we buy her? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

6
00:01:17,033 --> 00:01:18,605
We can buy her a book.

7
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:21,407
I think she already has the book. She doesn't read much.

8
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:23,393
Then let's buy her chocolate.

9
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:26,201
Not chocolate, she doesn't eat sweets now.

10
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:29,136
OK, then let's buy her flowers.

11
00:01:29,433 --> 00:01:31,040
And why do you want to buy that?

12
00:01:31,333 --> 00:01:33,867
Because she likes flowers and they will make her happy.

13
00:01:34,167 --> 00:01:37,763
That's true, flowers are a good idea. Let's buy her flowers.

14
00:01:38,067 --> 00:01:41,532
Situation 2: Going out together on Saturday night.

15
00:01:41,833 --> 00:01:48,706
On Saturday evening we want to go out together. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

16
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,923
How about going to the cinema?

17
00:02:03,233 --> 00:02:05,693
I don't feel like the cinema, I was there yesterday.

18
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,416
Then we can go to the theatre.

19
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:09,046
The theatre is too expensive.

20
00:02:09,333 --> 00:02:10,842
Then let’s go to a restaurant.

21
00:02:11,133 --> 00:02:12,650
And why do you want to go there?

22
00:02:12,933 --> 00:02:15,591
Because we are hungry and we can talk there in peace.

23
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:19,630
OK, that's a good idea. Let's go to a restaurant.

24
00:02:19,933 --> 00:02:23,604
Situation 3: A summer holiday together.

25
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:31,353
In summer we want to go on holiday together. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

26
00:02:44,067 --> 00:02:45,216
We can go to the seaside.

27
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:47,070
The sea is too far away.

28
00:02:47,367 --> 00:02:49,390
Then let's go to a big city.

29
00:02:49,700 --> 00:02:51,538
It's too hot in the city in summer.

30
00:02:51,833 --> 00:02:53,192
Then let's go to the mountains.

31
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,098
And why do you want to go there?

32
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,714
Because it's quiet there, the air is fresh and we can go hiking.

33
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,172
You're right. Let's go to the mountains.

34
00:03:01,467 --> 00:03:05,130
Situation 4: Friends are coming on Saturday.

35
00:03:05,433 --> 00:03:14,193
Some friends are coming over on Saturday. We want to cook dinner together. What shall we cook? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

36
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:28,213
We could cook fish.

37
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,169
I don't like fish, I don't like the taste.

38
00:03:30,467 --> 00:03:31,795
Then let's make pizza.

39
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:34,008
We had pizza last week.

40
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:35,776
Then let's cook goulash.

41
00:03:36,067 --> 00:03:37,608
And why do you want to cook that?

42
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:41,038
Because everyone likes goulash and we can cook it in advance.

43
00:03:41,333 --> 00:03:44,308
OK, goulash is a good idea. Let's cook goulash.

44
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:47,728
Situation 5: Starting a sport together.

45
00:03:48,033 --> 00:03:55,154
We want to start doing sport together. Which sport shall we do? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

46
00:04:07,867 --> 00:04:09,256
We could go running.

47
00:04:09,567 --> 00:04:11,989
I don't want to run, my knees hurt.

48
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:13,882
Then let's go cycling.

49
00:04:14,167 --> 00:04:15,092
I don't have a bike.

50
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,813
Then let's go swimming.

51
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:18,620
And why do you want to do that?

52
00:04:18,933 --> 00:04:21,485
Because swimming is healthy and the pool is close.

53
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,825
That's true. Let's go swimming.

54
00:04:24,133 --> 00:04:29,952
Now twelve phrases to reach agreement in any situation. Listen and repeat out loud.

55
00:04:30,667 --> 00:04:31,967
We could go to the cinema.

56
00:04:35,167 --> 00:04:36,600
What if we went to the mountains?

57
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,100
How about pizza?

58
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:45,800
Then let’s go to a restaurant.

59
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
OK, then we’ll cook goulash.

60
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,567
You’re right, the theatre is expensive.

61
00:04:59,767 --> 00:05:01,398
That’s a pity, but never mind.

62
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,300
I’d rather go to the seaside.

63
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:11,064
Because swimming is healthy.

64
00:05:14,267 --> 00:05:16,133
The cinema is cheap and close.

65
00:05:19,333 --> 00:05:22,032
I agree, that’s a good idea.

66
00:05:25,233 --> 00:05:26,459
It’ll be fun.

67
00:05:29,667 --> 00:05:32,725
Five typical mistakes that cost people points.

68
00:05:35,933 --> 00:05:43,378
Correct: Co kdybychom šli do kina? Make suggestions in full sentences: Můžeme…, Co kdybychom…

69
00:05:47,067 --> 00:05:54,313
Correct: Dobře, tak půjdeme do divadla. When the examiner disagrees, suggest another option.

70
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:05,274
Correct: Protože plavání je zdravé a bazén je blízko. At the end give a concrete reason: protože…

71
00:06:08,967 --> 00:06:17,399
Correct: Chceš jet na hory? In task 4 you talk to a friend: use the informal “ty” — máš, chceš, můžeš.

72
00:06:21,100 --> 00:06:28,421
Correct: Půjdeme do kina. After do use the genitive: do kina, do divadla, do restaurace.

73
00:06:29,633 --> 00:06:47,557
Summary. First: make suggestions in full sentences. Second: when the examiner disagrees, suggest another option. Third: at the end give a reason — protože. And fourth: with a friend you use “ty”.

74
00:06:48,767 --> 00:07:00,245
And you? Where would you go on holiday — the seaside, the mountains or a city? Write it in the comments as a full sentence and say why. And if the video helped, give it a like.

75
00:07:01,433 --> 00:07:17,736
On the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website you can practise all situations for free — the site plays the examiner. Link in the description. Tomorrow: big review of Writing — the form and the e-mail. Subscribe so you don’t miss anything.
